1
00:00:04,254 --> 00:00:06,214
There you are.

2
00:00:06,214 --> 00:00:09,175
How did you know
I was here?

3
00:00:10,427 --> 00:00:11,678
Don't be so tense.

4
00:00:11,678 --> 00:00:14,681
I just wanted to talk.

5
00:00:15,098 --> 00:00:17,475
About what?

6
00:00:17,475 --> 00:00:19,063
About Ji‑sung.

7
00:00:23,481 --> 00:00:25,650
You know why
he's still working here?

8
00:00:26,026 --> 00:00:29,029
Guilt.

9
00:00:29,988 --> 00:00:31,990
What are you talking about?

10
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:34,367
He had a younger teammate
who really looked up to him.

11
00:00:34,367 --> 00:00:37,370
Tried to follow in his moves
and got badly injured.

12
00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:41,374
That's how Ji-sung ended up
doing this.

13
00:00:43,251 --> 00:00:44,294
What's that
got to do with me?

14
00:00:44,294 --> 00:00:46,254
Think about it.

15
00:00:47,047 --> 00:00:50,050
Why do you think he's been

16
00:00:50,050 --> 00:00:53,053
treating you so well?

17
00:00:53,803 --> 00:00:56,765
Maybe he sees that guy in you.

18
00:00:56,765 --> 00:00:59,768
Not because you're special.

19
00:01:02,687 --> 00:01:05,690
Anyway...

20
00:01:06,232 --> 00:01:09,194
he's too talented
to stay stuck here.

21
00:01:10,820 --> 00:01:13,573
What do you say?

22
00:01:13,573 --> 00:01:14,908
About what?

23
00:01:14,908 --> 00:01:16,576
Let me help
with your training.

24
00:01:16,701 --> 00:01:18,536
Training?

25
00:01:18,536 --> 00:01:21,247
You'll need to tune up your
skills after rehab, right?

26
00:01:21,247 --> 00:01:22,999
Let me help you with that.

27
00:01:22,999 --> 00:01:24,626
Why would you help me?

28
00:01:24,626 --> 00:01:26,211
Because you're someone

29
00:01:26,211 --> 00:01:29,214
Ji-sung cares about.

30
00:01:29,756 --> 00:01:32,342
And... I guess it reminds me

31
00:01:32,342 --> 00:01:35,345
of when I was recovering
from an injury too.

32
00:01:36,846 --> 00:01:39,849
Just think it over.

33
00:01:45,146 --> 00:01:47,565
Was it all just guilt?
